!/data/compound_specimens/
# s33 n=7 corpus: 84 known 5906 classes + 3 urdvr 5907s (~530 KB total —
# unlike the 22,062-class n=6 archive, small enough to commit; makes every
# n=7 sweep reproducible from a fresh clone; see upstream5906_dump.py).
!/data/upstream5906/
!/data/upstream5907/
*.jsonl
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

